# Value residual learning (ResFormer, Zhou et al., 2024), the paper's 180M model: the
# first layer exports its attention values through the `v` port of gqa, and every
# later layer mixes them into its own as 0.5 v + 0.5 v1, as the official code does
# (Identity-ResFormer). value_residual=learned learns both weights from 0.5 instead
# (Learnable-ResFormer).
d_model    = 768
vocab_size = 50277

norm = rmsnorm(eps=1e-5)
attn = gqa(num_heads=12, num_kv_heads=12, rope=rope())
ffn  = gated_mlp(intermediate_size=2688, activation=swish)

first = [norm attn(v=@v1)] [norm ffn]
rest  = [norm attn(v=$v1)] [norm ffn]
model = embed first rest^11 norm head
